WEBVTT

00:00:01.140 --> 00:00:04.010
Hey, there! It's time for Kaleido Star!

00:00:04.010 --> 00:00:06.680
When you watch Kaleido Star,
please keep your room brightly lit,

00:00:06.680 --> 00:00:09.300
and sit as far from the TV as you can.

00:00:11.380 --> 00:00:14.250
Well, well, well.
Does everyone like amusement parks?

00:00:14.450 --> 00:00:16.420
Merry-go-rounds and roller coasters!

00:00:16.690 --> 00:00:18.350
They thrill you and
make your heart skip a beat.

00:00:18.350 --> 00:00:19.720
They're fun, aren't they?

00:00:19.960 --> 00:00:22.650
Our show is performed in a
different space from a regular stage.

00:00:22.920 --> 00:00:25.760
In order for everyone to enjoy our show,
we will give it everything we've got!

00:00:25.760 --> 00:00:28.390
Yeah! Yeah! Yeah!

00:00:30.770 --> 00:00:35.770
<i>The dream everyone is looking for
must be someplace</i>

00:00:30.770 --> 00:00:35.770
<i>Dare mo sagashiteru yume wa kitto aru</i>

00:00:35.770 --> 00:00:38.270
<i>It has to be somewhere</i>

00:00:35.770 --> 00:00:38.270
<i>Dokoka ni aru</i>

00:00:38.270 --> 00:00:45.980
<i>Until your dream comes true someday,
you're not alone</i>

00:00:38.270 --> 00:00:45.980
<i>Negai ga itsuka kanau made hitori ja nai</i>

00:00:54.020 --> 00:01:00.330
<i>Remember how I used to say
I could make it to the end?</i>

00:00:54.020 --> 00:01:00.330
<i>Saigo made yareru to ittetane</i>

00:01:00.330 --> 00:01:06.700
<i>I must have been pretending to be tough</i>

00:01:00.330 --> 00:01:06.700
<i>Kitto tsuyogatte itanda</i>

00:01:06.700 --> 00:01:15.410
<i>Everything I did was reckless
and it never got me anywhere</i>

00:01:06.700 --> 00:01:15.410
<i>Itsudatte muchabakka de
zutto karamawari de</i>

00:01:15.410 --> 00:01:21.910
<i>But you alone were always beside me</i>

00:01:15.410 --> 00:01:21.910
<i>Dakedo anata dake ga soba ni ita</i>

00:01:23.750 --> 00:01:28.660
<i>The dream everyone is looking for
must be somewhere</i>

00:01:23.750 --> 00:01:28.660
<i>Daremo sagashiteru yume wa kitto aru</i>

00:01:28.660 --> 00:01:31.260
<i>You can start going forward</i>

00:01:28.660 --> 00:01:31.260
<i>Aruki daseru</i>

00:01:31.260 --> 00:01:36.800
<i>From this moment, something will start</i>

00:01:31.260 --> 00:01:36.800
<i>Koko kara nani kaga hajimaru</i>

00:01:36.800 --> 00:01:38.830
<i>I want to believe that</i>

00:01:36.800 --> 00:01:38.830
<i>Shinjite itai</i>

00:01:38.830 --> 00:01:46.340
<i>The light I haven't seen yet
is beaming toward the promised place</i>

00:01:38.830 --> 00:01:46.340
<i>Mada minu hikari yakusoku no
basho e to tsuzuite yuku</i>

00:01:46.340 --> 00:01:56.810
<i>Until your dream comes true someday,
you're not alone</i>

00:01:46.340 --> 00:01:56.810
<i>Negai ga itsuka kanau made hitori ja naisa</i>

00:02:19.240 --> 00:02:22.270
Who? Who's that?

00:02:29.420 --> 00:02:30.820
She's amazing.

00:02:30.820 --> 00:02:34.290
She nailed everyone's attention in an instant.

00:02:34.290 --> 00:02:35.950
There's only one who's capable of
doing something like this...

00:02:39.390 --> 00:02:39.530
The Amazing Mystery Star

00:02:39.530 --> 00:02:42.700
The Amazing Mystery Star

00:02:39.530 --> 00:02:42.700
"The Amazing Mystery Star"

00:02:42.700 --> 00:02:45.430
The Amazing Mystery Star

00:02:46.200 --> 00:02:47.670
So, under these conditions,

00:02:47.670 --> 00:02:51.000
I would like to make a contract with
all members of Freedom Lights.

00:02:51.440 --> 00:02:52.910
What do you think everyone?

00:02:53.140 --> 00:02:53.540
We did it!

00:02:53.540 --> 00:02:54.700
We got a job!

00:02:53.540 --> 00:02:54.700
We did it!

00:02:55.180 --> 00:02:56.970
We're looking forward to working for you!

00:02:57.450 --> 00:02:59.050
I'm counting on you.

00:02:59.050 --> 00:03:01.210
Especially on that Masked Star.

00:03:01.450 --> 00:03:02.510
What?

00:03:02.750 --> 00:03:03.880
That masked...

00:03:04.120 --> 00:03:07.390
Well, she is really incredible.

00:03:07.390 --> 00:03:11.880
What would you say if I suggest that you
drastically increase the Masked Star's turn?

00:03:12.190 --> 00:03:14.760
But... that Masked Star is...

00:03:14.760 --> 00:03:16.030
I understand.

00:03:16.030 --> 00:03:17.430
We will definitely
consider what you just said.

00:03:17.700 --> 00:03:19.500
I'm counting on you.

00:03:22.200 --> 00:03:24.690
What are you going to do,
saying something like that?

00:03:24.840 --> 00:03:25.910
She's right.

00:03:25.910 --> 00:03:28.310
We don't know who that Masked Star is.

00:03:28.310 --> 00:03:30.240
You want to patch things up for the
moment by using a substitute?

00:03:30.850 --> 00:03:32.210
It's not necessary.

00:03:32.210 --> 00:03:33.010
What?

00:03:33.180 --> 00:03:36.510
'Cause I know the identity of that
Masked Star is Miss Layla.

00:03:38.490 --> 00:03:40.950
Miss Layla is not here right now.

00:03:42.260 --> 00:03:45.390
What? Then do you know about
what time she'll be home?

00:03:45.960 --> 00:03:50.420
She left here for Europe
about a week ago for a movie shoot.

00:03:50.730 --> 00:03:52.720
What? Europe?

00:03:53.230 --> 00:03:55.300
Isn't it some kind of mistake?

00:03:55.300 --> 00:03:57.170
No. Excuse me, but I have to go now.

00:03:57.940 --> 00:04:01.240
I cannot believe this.
Then, that Masked Star is...

00:04:01.340 --> 00:04:03.810
As we were saying, we have to use
a substitute tomorrow.

00:04:03.810 --> 00:04:05.080
You're right.

00:04:05.080 --> 00:04:06.550
Since SOMEONE caused all this...

00:04:06.550 --> 00:04:08.310
I think we have to ask her to do it.

00:04:12.720 --> 00:04:14.450
Here, wear this.

00:04:14.590 --> 00:04:15.850
Tada!

00:04:16.520 --> 00:04:18.130
You look good.

00:04:18.130 --> 00:04:20.500
It was worth staying up
all night making it.

00:04:20.500 --> 00:04:23.020
But the difference in height
is way too much.

00:04:23.700 --> 00:04:25.360
That's what I thought. So I brought these.

00:04:26.070 --> 00:04:28.300
I can't wear something like that and perform.

00:04:28.700 --> 00:04:32.570
Hey, let's try to contact
Miss Layla one more time.

00:04:32.940 --> 00:04:34.840
She's in Europe.

00:04:34.910 --> 00:04:37.470
Going over there is ten hours one way.

00:04:37.750 --> 00:04:39.440
It's impossible, Sora.

00:04:39.610 --> 00:04:43.650
Um.... Then why don't we tell the
Park Owner the truth?

00:04:43.650 --> 00:04:46.790
That the Masked Star is
not a member of Freedom Lights.

00:04:46.790 --> 00:04:49.280
And you're going to risk losing
the contract by doing that?

00:04:51.190 --> 00:04:52.190
Good morning.

00:04:52.190 --> 00:04:53.960
Hey, listen... Hm?

00:04:54.060 --> 00:04:54.700
Good morning.

00:04:54.700 --> 00:04:54.960
Rosetta.

00:04:54.700 --> 00:04:54.960
Good morning.

00:04:54.960 --> 00:04:55.760
Rosetta.

00:04:56.770 --> 00:04:59.400
Why is the Masked Star here?

00:04:59.400 --> 00:05:02.060
She looks different, somehow.

00:05:02.370 --> 00:05:06.970
Oh... No... It's not her.
Rosetta, it's me.

00:05:08.310 --> 00:05:09.540
Sora...

00:05:09.540 --> 00:05:14.810
Rosetta, tell them there's no way
I can substitute for the Masked Star!

00:05:15.250 --> 00:05:17.680
Sora is going to substitute
for the Masked Star?

00:05:17.820 --> 00:05:18.750
Yes...

00:05:18.750 --> 00:05:20.950
Oh, I never realized that
we can use that trick.

00:05:21.890 --> 00:05:23.620
Here, look at today's newspaper.

00:05:23.860 --> 00:05:26.420
What? This is about yesterday...

00:05:27.300 --> 00:05:31.130
"The amusement park where I went
with my family by chance.

00:05:31.130 --> 00:05:33.970
There, they were performing
a wonderful show

00:05:33.970 --> 00:05:35.840
as good as anything you'd see in Las Vegas.

00:05:35.840 --> 00:05:39.270
The performance of the Masked Star
who appeared at the finale

00:05:39.270 --> 00:05:41.180
was especially bold and elegant.

00:05:41.180 --> 00:05:44.310
When I thought I was able to see a show
like that just for the price of admission,

00:05:44.310 --> 00:05:46.980
it really moved me."

00:05:46.980 --> 00:05:48.040
Oh, no...

00:05:48.150 --> 00:05:51.620
Because of this article,
we may have more customers.

00:05:51.620 --> 00:05:54.350
That's impossible! It was just yesterday.

00:05:58.290 --> 00:06:02.060
We have plenty of time until
the Masked Star's show starts.

00:06:02.460 --> 00:06:06.660
Please don't push.
Please enter slowly in order.

00:06:07.140 --> 00:06:10.760
All these people came
to see the Masked Star?

00:06:10.940 --> 00:06:12.140
Now what are we gonna do?

00:06:12.140 --> 00:06:13.330
I didn't know you were here.

00:06:14.810 --> 00:06:17.780
Thanks to you, this is the biggest crowd
we ever had since we opened this park.

00:06:18.950 --> 00:06:19.780
Owner...

00:06:19.780 --> 00:06:20.710
That's nice.

00:06:20.920 --> 00:06:24.440
This is all thanks to that
Masked Star right there.

00:06:25.490 --> 00:06:26.620
No, not at all.

00:06:26.620 --> 00:06:29.650
We're also glad we could help you.

00:06:29.920 --> 00:06:32.220
That's also what this Masked Star is saying.

00:06:32.560 --> 00:06:36.590
Hm? I don't know why, but doesn't
she look different from yesterday?

00:06:37.730 --> 00:06:40.060
It's just your imagination.

00:06:40.340 --> 00:06:43.860
Hm... I wonder if it's my imagination.

00:06:44.040 --> 00:06:46.710
Well, anyway, we also have a
TV reporter today.

00:06:46.710 --> 00:06:48.210
So make sure to give us a nice show.

00:06:48.210 --> 00:06:49.870
A TV reporter?!

00:06:50.950 --> 00:06:53.180
Resign yourself to it, Sora.

00:07:23.140 --> 00:07:25.310
A flying jellyfish girl!

00:07:26.480 --> 00:07:27.810
It's not popular.

00:07:28.920 --> 00:07:30.820
Here I go! Yeah!

00:07:31.350 --> 00:07:32.590
Wow... Amazing!

00:07:32.590 --> 00:07:33.750
It's awesome!

00:07:34.020 --> 00:07:36.220
The Masked Star is late.

00:07:36.220 --> 00:07:37.380
Yeah, she is.

00:07:37.960 --> 00:07:40.090
Daddy, where's the Masked Star?

00:07:40.300 --> 00:07:42.420
Isn't it about the time she shows up?

00:07:42.530 --> 00:07:43.900
Yes, it's about time.

00:07:44.230 --> 00:07:45.300
Is it time yet?

00:07:45.300 --> 00:07:46.460
Who knows?

00:07:46.700 --> 00:07:47.790
It's the Masked Star!

00:07:54.410 --> 00:07:55.480
Close-up!

00:07:55.480 --> 00:07:56.270
Yes.

00:07:56.380 --> 00:07:57.650
Huh?

00:07:57.650 --> 00:07:58.510
What's wrong?

00:07:58.750 --> 00:08:01.480
Something is... different.

00:08:01.480 --> 00:08:02.280
What?

00:08:02.450 --> 00:08:05.320
Oh, I wish the real one would show up...

00:08:05.850 --> 00:08:09.850
Masked Star! Masked Star! Masked Star!
Masked Star! Masked Star!

00:08:10.330 --> 00:08:13.820
Masked Star! Masked Star! Masked Star!
Masked Star! Masked Star!

00:08:14.460 --> 00:08:16.530
I have no choice but to just do it!

00:08:16.530 --> 00:08:19.030
Just do it! Just do it!

00:08:19.030 --> 00:08:21.130
Ouch! Ouch! Huh? Oh...

00:08:43.730 --> 00:08:45.660
She's a fake.

00:08:47.930 --> 00:08:49.200
Disappointed...

00:08:49.200 --> 00:08:50.960
It was a waste of time
to come all the way down here.

00:08:51.370 --> 00:08:53.530
We're looking forward your next visit.

00:08:53.770 --> 00:08:57.400
The real Masked Star
will appear for sure tomorrow.

00:08:57.910 --> 00:09:00.700
I hope you're telling me the truth.
So tomorrow, she will be here.

00:09:00.780 --> 00:09:02.240
Yes, of course.

00:09:02.240 --> 00:09:05.610
So please make sure to advertise our park.

00:09:06.150 --> 00:09:07.140
I can't believe this.

00:09:10.450 --> 00:09:11.850
I can't have you doing this!

00:09:12.150 --> 00:09:14.460
Well, to tell you the truth...

00:09:14.460 --> 00:09:16.820
I don't want to hear your excuses!

00:09:16.820 --> 00:09:18.630
If the Masked Star doesn't
show up tomorrow,

00:09:18.630 --> 00:09:20.060
I'm going to cancel the contract!

00:09:20.060 --> 00:09:22.960
And you're going to pay for the forfeit!

00:09:22.960 --> 00:09:24.520
Capisci?!

00:09:26.930 --> 00:09:29.270
Did you come up with any good ideas?

00:09:29.440 --> 00:09:30.630
Not at all.

00:09:32.770 --> 00:09:34.210
I think...

00:09:34.580 --> 00:09:35.740
Yes, yes.

00:09:35.740 --> 00:09:38.470
That Masked Star is Miss Layla.
Don't you think?

00:09:40.480 --> 00:09:42.350
So, that's what you were thinking?

00:09:42.350 --> 00:09:44.250
I never realized that you're so tenacious.

00:09:44.390 --> 00:09:46.520
No matter what you think, it's impossible.

00:09:46.520 --> 00:09:49.560
Who else could it be?

00:09:49.560 --> 00:09:51.550
I can't guess who she is, but...

00:09:52.660 --> 00:09:54.990
'Cause Miss Layla...

00:09:55.600 --> 00:10:00.660
Even if Kaleido Stage closes its door,
it cannot close the door to my future.

00:10:01.300 --> 00:10:05.860
It will not be my last show, unless I wish it.

00:10:06.170 --> 00:10:09.140
I think that's the way Miss Layla really feels.

00:10:10.180 --> 00:10:12.710
There's no way I have time
for anything like that.

00:10:12.710 --> 00:10:16.780
First of all, my father is
managing my schedule right now.

00:10:17.290 --> 00:10:21.220
At that time, Miss Layla looked like
she was forcing herself to act that way.

00:10:22.190 --> 00:10:25.990
That's why I thought she came back
as the Masked Star.

00:10:27.930 --> 00:10:30.900
But I wonder if I'm wrong
like everybody else says.

00:10:31.600 --> 00:10:34.690
Well, then, I'm afraid we have to
use the last resort.

00:10:35.170 --> 00:10:36.670
What last resort?

00:10:36.670 --> 00:10:38.640
We're going to make the show get canceled.

00:10:38.770 --> 00:10:39.740
What?

00:10:39.740 --> 00:10:40.710
How?

00:10:41.080 --> 00:10:42.700
We're going to pray for rain!

00:10:42.980 --> 00:10:50.780
Rain, Rain. Please rain. Please rain.

00:10:50.950 --> 00:10:58.760
Rain, rain. Rain, rain, rain.
Drop rain. Drop rain. Drop rain.

00:11:01.300 --> 00:11:03.730
KATSU!

00:11:11.440 --> 00:11:13.070
It's a nice day.

00:11:13.910 --> 00:11:16.540
Once we get a clear day,
there's nothing we can do.

00:11:16.540 --> 00:11:19.110
Here, pull yourself together, and go.

00:11:19.110 --> 00:11:20.340
All right...

00:11:20.650 --> 00:11:23.250
If you're worried about the forfeit,
you don't need to worry.

00:11:23.250 --> 00:11:25.910
It's not an amount we can pay easily anyway.

00:11:26.290 --> 00:11:29.190
Once you come to terms with the fact that
you'll be paying it back the rest of your lives

00:11:29.190 --> 00:11:30.520
it'll be no big deal.

00:11:30.730 --> 00:11:33.490
Well... You're not encouraging at all.

00:11:36.460 --> 00:11:37.260
Good morning.

00:11:37.770 --> 00:11:39.790
Oh, good morning Kate.

00:11:40.000 --> 00:11:41.990
Don't they look wobbly?

00:11:42.340 --> 00:11:46.300
Don't worry. They're just a little depressed.

00:11:46.540 --> 00:11:47.440
Really?

00:11:47.440 --> 00:11:51.480
By the way, what's wrong
with the current Kaleido Stage?

00:11:51.480 --> 00:11:53.540
There haven't been any injuries
for a long time now.

00:11:54.180 --> 00:11:56.650
It seems that is the way Yuri does things.

00:11:56.650 --> 00:11:59.880
He's controlling all dangerous
performances by computer.

00:12:00.290 --> 00:12:02.020
Hmm, so that's why.

00:12:02.560 --> 00:12:04.790
But without any chance
to show off her skills,

00:12:04.790 --> 00:12:07.020
I can understand why Miss Layla
doesn't want to come back to Kaleido Stage.

00:12:07.360 --> 00:12:08.160
Yeah, I know.

00:12:08.930 --> 00:12:10.230
But as an emergency doctor,

00:12:10.230 --> 00:12:12.260
I don't have a chance to
utilize my skills either.

00:12:13.940 --> 00:12:19.070
All right now, I'm sure the Masked Star
will show up today.

00:12:21.310 --> 00:12:23.870
Thirty more minutes until the show starts.

00:12:24.150 --> 00:12:26.250
Until our life ends...

00:12:26.250 --> 00:12:28.220
Thirty more minutes.

00:12:28.220 --> 00:12:29.150
Oh, dear...

00:12:29.150 --> 00:12:31.080
Hey, everyone!

00:12:31.490 --> 00:12:35.760
'Cause unless the Masked Star shows up,
our show will end today.

00:12:35.760 --> 00:12:39.450
And we will have the fate of paying back
the enormous forfeit fee.

00:12:42.960 --> 00:12:46.630
Hey, these kids want
to get some autographs.

00:12:47.030 --> 00:12:47.930
Autograph?

00:12:48.470 --> 00:12:49.460
I see.

00:12:49.840 --> 00:12:53.270
I'm sorry, but the Masked Star has
some business to take care of, and...

00:12:53.470 --> 00:12:54.810
No.

00:12:54.810 --> 00:12:57.370
I want an autograph from that person.

00:12:57.810 --> 00:12:58.940
Me?

00:12:59.380 --> 00:13:00.180
Yes.

00:13:01.450 --> 00:13:02.680
Thank you.

00:13:04.020 --> 00:13:08.180
I had so much fun. Right, brother?

00:13:08.390 --> 00:13:11.650
We saw the show for the first time
the day before yesterday.

00:13:11.760 --> 00:13:13.060
So you guys came back here again.

00:13:13.290 --> 00:13:18.230
Yes. Well, my brother didn't have
enough money for the admission fee.

00:13:18.230 --> 00:13:20.500
So he got an advance on his allowance.

00:13:21.040 --> 00:13:24.540
He begged Mom a lot,
saying that he would pay her back

00:13:24.540 --> 00:13:26.170
by mowing the lawn for the next month.

00:13:26.240 --> 00:13:29.330
Melissa, you don't have to tell them all that!

00:13:29.510 --> 00:13:32.910
But he paid for mine too.

00:13:32.910 --> 00:13:34.920
So, I'm going to help him mow the lawn.

00:13:34.920 --> 00:13:35.940
Right?

00:13:36.020 --> 00:13:39.020
You don't need to do anything.

00:13:39.020 --> 00:13:43.160
If you help me, you'll end up
increasing what I need to get done.

00:13:43.160 --> 00:13:45.190
I'm a big girl.

00:13:45.190 --> 00:13:47.350
I can do all kinds of stuff by myself.

00:13:47.730 --> 00:13:51.100
They're looking forward
to seeing my show this much.

00:13:51.430 --> 00:13:53.670
All right, both of you.

00:13:53.670 --> 00:13:57.410
Today's show will be
a lot more fun than the last.

00:13:57.410 --> 00:13:59.460
I'll give you a show worth more
than a whole month of lawn mowing.

00:13:59.670 --> 00:14:01.230
Wow!

00:14:02.310 --> 00:14:04.210
Good luck!

00:14:04.510 --> 00:14:06.710
Please have fun watching the show.

00:14:06.710 --> 00:14:09.050
Making a promise something like that.

00:14:09.050 --> 00:14:10.750
I bet you'll end up disappointing them.

00:14:11.050 --> 00:14:14.220
No, I won't. I'll never disappoint them.

00:14:14.520 --> 00:14:16.850
I won't allow myself to disappoint them.

00:14:27.470 --> 00:14:32.430
So, I think we have no choice
but to do our best now.

00:14:32.840 --> 00:14:34.940
Even though we don't have the
Masked Star with us,

00:14:34.940 --> 00:14:37.930
Let's make our show
satisfying for the audience.

00:14:38.080 --> 00:14:40.250
Either way, we have to pay for the forfeit.

00:14:40.250 --> 00:14:42.080
So why don't we
let ourselves go and perform?

00:14:42.380 --> 00:14:43.180
Yep.

00:14:43.320 --> 00:14:45.580
Mia, don't you have any ideas?

00:14:45.890 --> 00:14:48.750
Something we can prepare in
the next 15 minutes...

00:14:49.420 --> 00:14:51.050
Okay, I will come up with something.

00:14:51.590 --> 00:14:57.050
Also, each of us should try to think if there
is anything we can do better than yesterday.

00:14:57.260 --> 00:14:58.060
Yes.

00:14:58.600 --> 00:14:59.630
Oh...

00:14:59.630 --> 00:15:01.200
Did you come up with something?

00:15:01.200 --> 00:15:02.270
Wait.

00:15:02.270 --> 00:15:06.040
If it takes five seconds for each...

00:15:06.270 --> 00:15:08.080
Good! Maybe, we can do this!

00:15:08.080 --> 00:15:10.340
Ken, Marion, please help.

00:15:10.340 --> 00:15:11.350
What? What?

00:15:11.350 --> 00:15:12.780
We can take care of this.

00:15:14.880 --> 00:15:16.250
I hope it starts soon.

00:15:16.480 --> 00:15:18.650
I want to see the...

00:15:19.790 --> 00:15:21.160
They're late.

00:15:21.160 --> 00:15:24.150
It's already past the starting time.

00:15:24.430 --> 00:15:27.050
I hope you're not telling me
that they took off.

00:15:29.560 --> 00:15:31.120
There's no way...

00:15:37.510 --> 00:15:38.300
Here they go!

00:15:52.690 --> 00:15:53.780
Here!

00:16:04.670 --> 00:16:06.160
I can't see.

00:16:24.290 --> 00:16:25.080
This way!

00:16:25.320 --> 00:16:26.490
Hey! There!

00:16:26.490 --> 00:16:27.150
Someone's there!

00:16:27.150 --> 00:16:27.520
The Masked Star?

00:16:27.150 --> 00:16:27.520
Someone's there!

00:16:27.520 --> 00:16:28.160
The Masked Star?

00:16:28.160 --> 00:16:29.090
No, that's not her.

00:16:31.260 --> 00:16:32.990
Over there!

00:16:33.490 --> 00:16:35.230
Hey, don't miss that photo op.

00:16:35.230 --> 00:16:35.920
Yes.

00:16:39.400 --> 00:16:41.100
Brother...

00:16:47.710 --> 00:16:49.470
Let's go Melissa!

00:16:49.610 --> 00:16:50.540
What?

00:16:51.450 --> 00:16:54.010
It says "Keep out! "

00:16:54.150 --> 00:16:55.410
Don't worry.

00:17:07.130 --> 00:17:09.720
I wonder if those kids are watching.

00:17:12.470 --> 00:17:13.600
The Masked Star!

00:17:13.600 --> 00:17:14.300
Finally!

00:17:14.300 --> 00:17:15.500
The Masked Star!

00:17:15.500 --> 00:17:16.300
Bravo!

00:17:27.720 --> 00:17:32.290
No matter what I think, there is only
one person who can do this.

00:17:32.290 --> 00:17:33.310
That is...

00:17:38.190 --> 00:17:39.730
I'm scared.

00:17:39.730 --> 00:17:40.960
Be a big girl.

00:17:43.960 --> 00:17:44.760
Those kids!

00:17:47.570 --> 00:17:49.040
Call a rescue team quick!

00:17:49.040 --> 00:17:49.730
Yes!

00:17:50.100 --> 00:17:51.400
The ladder is ready to fall off.

00:17:54.040 --> 00:17:55.240
What?

00:17:55.910 --> 00:17:58.640
Oh, I know! I should use the rope.

00:17:58.880 --> 00:18:00.610
Help!

00:18:00.610 --> 00:18:02.380
I'm scared!

00:18:02.780 --> 00:18:03.910
All right...

00:18:15.760 --> 00:18:16.820
Okay...

00:18:29.910 --> 00:18:33.680
The Masked Star is here.
You go first, Melissa.

00:18:33.780 --> 00:18:35.650
What about you?

00:18:35.750 --> 00:18:38.220
I'm your big brother. So I will go next.

00:18:40.590 --> 00:18:42.060
Melissa, go!

00:18:42.220 --> 00:18:43.020
Okay.

00:18:58.440 --> 00:18:59.530
Miss!

00:19:14.720 --> 00:19:15.950
You're okay now.

00:19:21.800 --> 00:19:22.690
She's going to crash!

00:19:23.460 --> 00:19:24.760
Hold on tight.

00:19:27.170 --> 00:19:28.330
Oh... Shoot...

00:19:29.800 --> 00:19:30.800
If I stay like this,

00:19:30.800 --> 00:19:32.400
I don't know where I'm going to hit.

00:19:52.460 --> 00:19:53.290
Good.

00:19:56.230 --> 00:19:57.790
I'm glad...

00:19:58.230 --> 00:20:00.220
Thank you miss.

00:20:00.400 --> 00:20:01.700
You're welcome.

00:20:02.670 --> 00:20:03.470
What?

00:20:26.530 --> 00:20:29.390
The identity of Masked Star is...
as I thought...

00:20:29.660 --> 00:20:31.820
I can't think of anybody else other
than Miss Layla.

00:20:32.930 --> 00:20:35.270
Elegant performance, strong movement...

00:20:36.040 --> 00:20:37.800
They're the same as Miss Layla.

00:20:38.240 --> 00:20:40.740
This feeling traveling through me,

00:20:40.740 --> 00:20:43.370
and everything else
is the same as Miss Layla's.

00:20:50.280 --> 00:20:54.240
I believe that the Masked Star is Miss Layla.

00:20:55.220 --> 00:20:56.820
If Miss Layla is with us,

00:20:56.820 --> 00:20:59.990
I think creating our own
Kaleido Stage is possible.

00:21:01.260 --> 00:21:04.490
Not only that...
I think I'm able to do anything.

00:21:04.930 --> 00:21:07.530
One day... without that mask,

00:21:07.530 --> 00:21:09.430
I hope we can appear
on stage together again.

00:21:10.400 --> 00:21:13.070
One day...

00:21:25.590 --> 00:21:26.750
The Chariot...

00:21:26.750 --> 00:21:28.650
The opportunity is right.

00:21:29.290 --> 00:21:31.350
The only thing left is going forward.

00:21:35.000 --> 00:21:37.760
It seems the show in the amusement park
is beating our show.

00:21:38.030 --> 00:21:41.970
Our show is, like, showy
using computers and stuff.

00:21:41.970 --> 00:21:44.100
But, like, it makes the show kinda fake.

00:21:44.710 --> 00:21:47.830
But, of course, it makes my job easy.

00:21:48.580 --> 00:21:50.510
And, of course, I don't need to worry
about injuries either.

00:21:51.550 --> 00:21:52.340
Oh...

00:21:56.120 --> 00:21:58.380
Let's practice, practice.

00:21:58.620 --> 00:22:02.150
In this way, a brother and sister
were rescued safely.

00:22:03.060 --> 00:22:06.630
Later, both Sora Naegino and the Masked
Star who performed after this incident

00:22:06.630 --> 00:22:07.290
won applause from all the audience
who were there at that time, and...

00:22:07.290 --> 00:22:10.400
Damned Masked Star...

00:22:07.290 --> 00:22:10.400
won applause from all the audience
who were there at that time, and...

00:22:10.400 --> 00:22:11.590
That is...

00:22:10.400 --> 00:22:11.590
won applause from all the audience
who were there at that time, and...

00:22:20.410 --> 00:22:22.380
Next Kaleido Star

00:22:23.010 --> 00:22:24.670
Yuri, thank you for the flowers.

00:22:24.810 --> 00:22:28.580
And so, Freedom Lights' performance
is on the right track, but...

00:22:28.580 --> 00:22:30.620
But Yuri started meddling
in our business again, and...

00:22:30.620 --> 00:22:33.020
It seems he's intent on
completely destroying us.

00:22:33.020 --> 00:22:34.690
And the mysterious Masked Star.

00:22:34.690 --> 00:22:36.320
When the Masked Star's mask was removed,

00:22:36.320 --> 00:22:38.220
the things reflected in her eyes are...

00:22:38.330 --> 00:22:40.230
The things reflected in her eyes are!
The things reflected in her eyes are!

00:22:40.660 --> 00:22:43.060
Next time on Kaleido Star,
"The Amazing Resolve Beneath the Mask"

00:22:43.060 --> 00:22:44.970
The Amazing Resolve Beneath the Mask

00:22:43.060 --> 00:22:44.970
Next time on Kaleido Star,
"The Amazing Resolve Beneath the Mask"

00:22:44.970 --> 00:22:45.570
The Amazing Resolve Beneath the Mask

00:22:45.570 --> 00:22:51.640
The Amazing Resolve Beneath the Mask

00:22:45.570 --> 00:22:51.640
My wings are my dream
and on towards the sky...

00:22:51.640 --> 00:23:04.350
<i>I'm here between the sky and the roads,
and facing against the wind</i>

00:22:51.640 --> 00:23:04.350
<i>Boku wa koko ni iru
sora to michi no aida de mukai kaze</i>

00:23:04.350 --> 00:23:18.230
<i>And I'm facing forward so the sorrow
doesn't rain down ever again</i>

00:23:04.350 --> 00:23:18.230
<i>Soshite mae o muiteiru
mou nido to kanashimi ga furanai youni to</i>

00:23:18.230 --> 00:23:24.170
<i>I came all the way here after
I jumped over that wall</i>

00:23:18.230 --> 00:23:24.170
<i>Ano kabe o koete kokomade kitanda</i>

00:23:24.170 --> 00:23:31.380
<i>There are many times
when I just want to run away</i>

00:23:24.170 --> 00:23:31.380
<i>Nigedashitaku naru koto wa nando mo aru</i>

00:23:31.380 --> 00:23:36.820
<i>But I'm still here,
so, I'm not daunted that much</i>

00:23:31.380 --> 00:23:36.820
<i>Dakedo kokoni irunara taishite bibitte inai</i>

00:23:36.820 --> 00:23:44.390
<i>The poem I scribbled down, I can just
start writing over from the beginning</i>

00:23:36.820 --> 00:23:44.390
<i>Kakinaguri no uta "hajimekara yareba iisa"</i>

00:23:44.390 --> 00:23:49.830
<i>Unable to write it well, I'm laughing</i>

00:23:44.390 --> 00:23:49.830
<i>Umaku kakenaku te boku wa waratte iru</i>
